  "description": "Chopper-Style Stretch Cruiser Bike – Built for Performance and Comfort\nThe Tracer Leopard 3i Pro Chopper-Style Stretch Cruiser Bike features a 3-speed internal rear hub, perfect for smooth gear shifts as you cruise on various roads. With its BMX steel crankset and dual suspension spring fork, the bike ensures maximum control and comfort on every ride. The modern fat tires and high-rise handlebars deliver a luxurious stretch cruiser experience. Equipped with disc brakes and ergonomic handles, this bike offers superior road grip and excellent biking performance, all while keeping you comfortable on your adventures.\n\nHANDLEBAR\nTracer Steel Hi-Rise Hi 11” W29.5” 22.2mm\n\nSADDLE\n\nVacuum elastic PVC leather high density PU foam with springs\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nBMX Cranks set Bottom Bracket Cr-Mo axle.\n\nRIMS\nAlloy FAT Front 3' Rear 4\" 26” *36H*14G Spoke wheelset..\n\nREAR HUB\nAlloy Sturmey Archer SX-RK3-SP Disc Brake 3/8”x14Gx36H\n\nWEIGHT\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality, weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
